  "details": "Hello, I've been trying to do animations that are promixmity based that trigger the closer you get to something like someones face or hand, however currently there is only the Sphere and Capsule neither of which work for what i'm trying to acheieve as when using promity its the center of the contact receiver that fully activates the animation and currently if you want to make an animation based on  something infront of you there is no way you can make that animation end in any slow or smoothe way as even if you were to make the sphere huge or make a capsule thats super long the distance from the centre never really gets much bigger, what i'm requesting is either to possibly change where the \"centre\" of the capsule contact receiver is or possibly a new type of contact recever that your can make get bigger in one direction to make a long smoothe transition for the promimity animation. I really hope what I'm asking for makes sense as cureently theres no real reliable way to create some animations and having something like this would just increase the amount of things we can achieve with avatar dynamics",
